# Build context is the repo root; only the pnpm workspace goes into the web / admin images.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/web
!apps/admin
!packages/ui
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
# Never bake local env files (.env.local would override the build args); NEXT_PUBLIC_* come from build args.
**/.env
**/.env.*
apps/Dockerfile*
